<section style="padding:80px 0 32px;">
  <div class="max-site" style="max-width:760px;">
    <span class="eyebrow" style="font-size:19px; display:block; margin-bottom:14px;">How it works,</span>
    <h1 class="display hiw-title">Three steps. <em style="color:var(--color-clay);">One quiet home.</em></h1>
    <p style="font-size:21px; color:var(--color-ink-soft); line-height:1.55; margin:24px 0 0;">
      We work with you the way a thoughtful designer would, in your voice. Your website is built from a library of tested building blocks, matched to your conversation with Haven, and needs a recorded review approval before it goes live.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="padding:48px 0 96px;">
  <div class="max-site" style="max-width:1080px;">
    <div class="hiw-steps">
      <article class="hiw-step">
        <div class="display hiw-step__num">I</div>
        <div class="hiw-step__rule"></div>
        <h3 class="display hiw-step__title">You begin a conversation</h3>
        <p class="hiw-step__body">
          Tell us, in plain English, about the work you do: your offerings, your clients, the rhythm of your week. Haven, an AI companion, listens and writes a summary of everything about your website from your own words. Talk for as long as it feels right.
        </p>
        <span class="hand hiw-step__sign">No time limit.</span>
      </article>
      <article class="hiw-step">
        <div class="display hiw-step__num">II</div>
        <div class="hiw-step__rule"></div>
        <h3 class="display hiw-step__title">We make it together</h3>
        <p class="hiw-step__body">
          Your site is built from a library of tested building blocks, matched to what you told Haven and set in your voice. You can walk through it as a preview, and it needs a recorded review approval before it goes live.
        </p>
        <span class="hand hiw-step__sign">A recorded review approval before it goes live.</span>
      </article>
      <article class="hiw-step">
        <div class="display hiw-step__num">III</div>
        <div class="hiw-step__rule"></div>
        <h3 class="display hiw-step__title">It's yours, kept tidy</h3>
        <p class="hiw-step__body">
          Your website is yours. We host it, watch uptime, and answer when you write. Unlimited revisions and rebuilds across the years. Haven stays available whenever you need her.
        </p>
        <span class="hand hiw-step__sign">Yours across the years.</span>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="padding:0 0 56px;">
  <div class="max-site" style="max-width:880px;">
    <div class="hiw-companion">
      <figure style="margin:0;">
        <img src="/brand-harbor/haven-portrait.webp"
             alt="Haven, an AI companion in a warm portrait beside the lighthouse at dusk."
             style="display:block; width:100%; height:auto; border-radius: 5px;" />
      </figure>
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow" style="font-size:19px; display:block; margin-bottom:14px;">Your AI companion,</span>
        <h2 class="display hiw-companion__title">Meet Haven.</h2>
        <p style="font-size:19px; color:var(--color-ink-soft); line-height:1.65; margin:18px 0 28px;">
          Haven is an AI who listens during the conversation and helps you find the words. She is honest about being AI; she does not pretend to be a person. She stays available after your website goes live; ask her anything about your work, your website, or what to write next.
        </p>
        <a href="/try" class="btn btn-ghost"><span class="arrow">Begin a conversation with Haven</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="padding:16px 0 120px;">
  <div class="max-site" style="max-width:760px;">
    <div class="hiw-final">
      <span class="eyebrow" style="font-size:19px; display:block; margin-bottom:14px;">When you're ready,</span>
      <h2 class="display" style="font-size:44px; margin:0 0 22px; line-height:1.05;">Begin a conversation.</h2>
      <p style="font-size:19px; color:var(--color-ink-soft); line-height:1.6; max-width:540px; margin:0 0 28px;">
        Tell us about your work. Haven will write back. Talk for as long as it feels right. When it's time, you decide.
      </p>
      <div style="display:flex; gap:18px; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center;">
        <a href="/try" class="btn btn-primary">Begin a conversation &rarr;</a>
        <a href="/pricing" class="btn btn-quiet"><span class="arrow">See what's included</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

